invalid type: string "Q: How to stop a SIP in an Unifi Mutual fund online?\nA: Yes, you can stop your SIP online at any time by just placing a Cancel SIP request.\n      To stop or cancel your SIP, you can either log in to the Unifi Mutual funds website with a folio number or contact your agent or\n      check the steps on the online investment platform where you have invested.", expected ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ